			"Message": "refactor(Mountain): Standardize function signatures and resolve Rust clippy lints\n\nAddress formatting inconsistencies and clippy warnings across the `WindServiceHandlers` module and the main IPC dispatcher. Standardize multi-line function signature formatting to ensure the `Result` type appears on the same line as the signature where possible, and align parameter lists for readability.\n\nUpdate internal dispatch calls in `mountain_ipc_invoke` to use explicit `.Fn` syntax for `WaitForClientConnection`, `SendRequest`, and `SendNotification` methods, resolving method resolution ambiguity. Adjust import grouping in `mod.rs` and fix spacing around variable declarations to comply with Rust formatting standards.\n\nThese changes improve code consistency and ensure the build passes without clippy warnings while maintaining functional parity for configuration, extension, and search IPC handlers.",
			"SHA": "d2cf6dccc0fe0dfc95e50ced5c54ee90efcfd7c2"
		},
		{
			"Author": "Nikola Hristov",
